%li.jpost#support
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.fa.fa-plus
    %h3.name Support Engineer

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        San Francisco, CA, or Singapore

      %p Nitrous.IO support engineers author platform documentation and provide guidance to users so they can build amazing applications.
      %p We’re looking for technically-inclined individuals with a passion for writing and technical education to engage our rapidly growing base of users.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Interface with users for technical support
          %li Author tutorials, walkthroughs &amp; &ldquo;how to&rdquo; videos about platform features
          %li Aggregate &amp; perform analysis on support requests to inform product decisionmaking

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Great oral and written communication skills
          %li Experience with technical writing
          %li Familiarity with Ruby, Python, Node.js, or Go a plus
          %li A passion for helping and teaching, especially within the technology sphere

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Resume
            %li Writing Samples
            %li Links to blog or technical documentation if applicable

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Support%20Engineer', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
